sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant FE as Frontend (HTML/CSS/JS)
    participant API as REST API
    participant Auth as AuthController (Laravel)
    participant Dash as DashboardController (Laravel)
    participant UM as UserModel
    participant TM as TaskModel
    participant HM as HabitModel
    participant DB as MySQL Database

    User->>Browser: Enter email and password
    Browser->>FE: Submit login form
    FE->>API: POST /api/login {email, password}
    API->>Auth: login(request)
    Auth->>UM: findByEmail(email)
    UM->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
    DB-->>UM: user record
    UM-->>Auth: user
    Auth->>Auth: verify password hash
    alt credentials invalid
        Auth-->>API: 401 Unauthorized
        API-->>FE: error
        FE-->>Browser: show error message
    else credentials valid
        Auth->>Auth: generate JWT token
        Auth-->>API: 200 OK {token, user}
        API-->>FE: {token, user}
        FE->>Browser: store token in localStorage
        FE->>Browser: redirect to /dashboard
    end

    Note over FE,DB: Dashboard load

    Browser->>FE: GET /dashboard
    FE->>API: GET /api/dashboard (Bearer token)
    API->>Dash: index(request)
    Dash->>Dash: validate JWT
    Dash->>TM: getUserTasks(user_id)
    TM->>DB: SELECT * FROM tasks WHERE user_id = ?
    DB-->>TM: task rows
    TM-->>Dash: tasks[]
    Dash->>HM: getUserHabits(user_id)
    HM->>DB: SELECT * FROM habits WHERE user_id = ?
    DB-->>HM: habit rows
    HM-->>Dash: habits[]
    Dash->>Dash: aggregate statistics
    Dash-->>API: 200 OK {tasks, habits, stats}
    API-->>FE: dashboard data
    FE->>FE: render charts
    FE-->>Browser: display dashboard
    Browser-->>User: view dashboard
